cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Progravity in your research, please cite it."
type: software
title: Progravity
version: 4.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-11
authors:
  - name: Progravity contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/SalauddinAhmad/progravity
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Progravity is a model-agnostic reliability runtime for coding agents. It adds
  inspect-before-edit, requirement tracking, evidence-backed verification,
  quota-aware orchestration, and interruption recovery on compatible hosts
  (initial targets: Gemini models in Antigravity, plus OpenCode).
  ProgravityBench provides a reproducible trajectory-level benchmark
  for measuring the reliability impact of the runtime.
keywords:
  - coding agents
  - reliability runtime
  - Antigravity
  - OpenCode
  - agent benchmarking
  - software engineering automation
